(5884140, 857294, 73056, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Perfect timing, fantastic angle. I love those matted balls of snow, even under the jaw. It''s a wonder they can stay warm.</td>', 'Wonderful! Perfect timing, fantastic angle. I love those matted balls of snow, even under the jaw. It''s a wonder they can stay warm.', '2010-03-01 00:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
