(5884184, 856544, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great idea and I like it as a b/w.</td>', 'Great idea and I like it as a b/w.', '2010-03-01 00:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884190, 857060, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nicely done family portrait!</td>', 'Nicely done family portrait!', '2010-03-01 00:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884192, 857524, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very soft and lots of unattractive high ISO grain, I''m afraid. Of course, I don''t know how you shot this, but for something like this, I would set the camera on a tripod and shoot at the lowest ISO with the self timer or a remote. That can help to get a sharp, noise free image in such dim conditions.</td>', 'Very soft and lots of unattractive high ISO grain, I''m afraid. Of course, I don''t know how you shot this, but for something like this, I would set the camera on a tripod and shoot at the lowest ISO with the self timer or a remote. That can help to get a sharp, noise free image in such dim conditions.', '2010-03-01 00:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884198, 856763, 83313, '<td valign="top">I generally like this, but 2 biggies are bringing it down for me. <br/>1) The harsh midday sun is creating some shadows that don''t help it any. (Some careful selective editing can help in some cases.)<br/>2) The very tip of the sculpture is cut off at the frame edge.</td>', 'I generally like this, but 2 biggies are bringing it down for me. 1) The harsh midday sun is creating some shadows that don''t help it any. (Some careful selective editing can help in some cases.)2) The very tip of the sculpture is cut off at the frame edge.', '2010-03-01 00:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884200, 857003, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great action capture and I like it in b/w. I''d like to see it cropped just slightly above the tops of those two centered trees, but that''s just my personal preference. :) Nicely done.</td>', 'Great action capture and I like it in b/w. I''d like to see it cropped just slightly above the tops of those two centered trees, but that''s just my personal preference. :) Nicely done.', '2010-03-01 00:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
