(5885114, 857531, 94437, '<td valign="top">1st thought was "great photo", then I thought "that cant be a real bird, how can it fly, it must be photo shopped"<br/>But I know its a real bird in good focus and nice bg and well framed on two side.</td>', '1st thought was "great photo", then I thought "that cant be a real bird, how can it fly, it must be photo shopped"But I know its a real bird in good focus and nice bg and well framed on two side.', '2010-03-01 13:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885135, 857135, 110576, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy, but cool idea!</td>', 'A bit grainy, but cool idea!', '2010-03-01 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885143, 857294, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Great subject, and the contrast of the mane against the coat, and both against the  snow is lovely. Plus you got the subject looking at you.  I find the "gap" on the left side a bit distracting particularly as the brightest area of snow is there drawing my eye to it. Perhaps cropping more off that side or darkening that area might have prevented that.  Still, it gets a 7.</td>', 'Nice capture. Great subject, and the contrast of the mane against the coat, and both against the  snow is lovely. Plus you got the subject looking at you.  I find the "gap" on the left side a bit distracting particularly as the brightest area of snow is there drawing my eye to it. Perhaps cropping more off that side or darkening that area might have prevented that.  Still, it gets a 7.', '2010-03-01 13:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885213, 857404, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice image overall. Well processed and I like the brick path leading into the picture and the group of three people adds to the composition. For me though the wrought iron railing tends to interfere with the "flow" from the foreground into the rest of the image.</td>', 'Nice image overall. Well processed and I like the brick path leading into the picture and the group of three people adds to the composition. For me though the wrought iron railing tends to interfere with the "flow" from the foreground into the rest of the image.', '2010-03-01 14:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885232, 857060, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  Great idea and execution! Great capture of the light on their hair, especially the youngest one on the right.</td>', 'Wonderful.  Great idea and execution! Great capture of the light on their hair, especially the youngest one on the right.', '2010-03-01 14:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885247, 857519, 1569, '<td valign="top">I think this one would have had more impact if you had cropped it from the top down to just above the top of the opening. The cats eyes glaring out and the empty space on the left (with the slight color change of the packaging tape)really make a dramatic pix. IMO</td>', 'I think this one would have had more impact if you had cropped it from the top down to just above the top of the opening. The cats eyes glaring out and the empty space on the left (with the slight color change of the packaging tape)really make a dramatic pix. IMO', '2010-03-01 14:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885256, 856427, 1569, '<td valign="top">After the challenge is over I would like to see this in color.</td>', 'After the challenge is over I would like to see this in color.', '2010-03-01 14:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885278, 856820, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures and shapes here, clearly framed. To my eyes, the area of foreground is rather uninteresting compared to the rest of the image.  This might have been even better with a tighter crop at the bottom, perhaps.</td>', 'Lovely textures and shapes here, clearly framed. To my eyes, the area of foreground is rather uninteresting compared to the rest of the image.  This might have been even better with a tighter crop at the bottom, perhaps.', '2010-03-01 14:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885331, 856815, 110576, '<td valign="top">The crispness and clarity of the rotunda is really nice and the colors are absolutely beautiful, but the leaves in the bottom left and center are slightly distracting. I like the flag blowing in the wind, too. Overall, a really great shot!</td>', 'The crispness and clarity of the rotunda is really nice and the colors are absolutely beautiful, but the leaves in the bottom left and center are slightly distracting. I like the flag blowing in the wind, too. Overall, a really great shot!', '2010-03-01 14:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885336, 856424, 110576, '<td valign="top">The choice to shoot this in b&amp;w was a good one. Timeless!</td>', 'The choice to shoot this in b&w was a good one. Timeless!', '2010-03-01 15:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885339, 857018, 110576, '<td valign="top">It took me a second to realize that what I thought were clothes in the bottom of the basket was actually a cat. Interesting take on the challenge</td>', 'It took me a second to realize that what I thought were clothes in the bottom of the basket was actually a cat. Interesting take on the challenge', '2010-03-01 15:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885354, 856381, 110576, '<td valign="top">Its a little difficult to make out what I''m looking at, but it has a neat eerie feeling to it!</td>', 'Its a little difficult to make out what I''m looking at, but it has a neat eerie feeling to it!', '2010-03-01 15:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
