(5885363, 856769, 110576, '<td valign="top">This shot is stunning. I can''t decide if the branch that pokes in from the left side is distracting or if it makes my eye move naturally toward the bridge. Either way, nice job!</td>', 'This shot is stunning. I can''t decide if the branch that pokes in from the left side is distracting or if it makes my eye move naturally toward the bridge. Either way, nice job!', '2010-03-01 15:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
