(5886605, 857589, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a tough exposure.  Think I''d like to see a bit more of the view and less of the gazebo.  Actually, I''d probably get bogged down trying to take a picture of the floorboards framed by the shadows ;-)</td>', 'Looks like a tough exposure.  Think I''d like to see a bit more of the view and less of the gazebo.  Actually, I''d probably get bogged down trying to take a picture of the floorboards framed by the shadows ;-)', '2010-03-02 08:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886608, 857161, 65234, '<td valign="top">The frame is much more interesting than the lakeshore.  Which is fine in this challenge, I guess.  Still, I''d like to see the lakeshore less centered.  Makes for a more interesting composition to my eye.</td>', 'The frame is much more interesting than the lakeshore.  Which is fine in this challenge, I guess.  Still, I''d like to see the lakeshore less centered.  Makes for a more interesting composition to my eye.', '2010-03-02 08:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886610, 857533, 65234, '<td valign="top">She has a lovely smile :-)  Interesting scene; certainly evokes memories of teenage daydreams.</td>', 'She has a lovely smile :-)  Interesting scene; certainly evokes memories of teenage daydreams.', '2010-03-02 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886614, 857438, 65234, '<td valign="top">Now I''ve got that song in my head!  The asymmetry in such a symmetrical composition is a little disturbing to my eye ... that could be a good thing, since it keeps me looking.  My favorite part of this is the reflection in the stem; way cool!</td>', 'Now I''ve got that song in my head!  The asymmetry in such a symmetrical composition is a little disturbing to my eye ... that could be a good thing, since it keeps me looking.  My favorite part of this is the reflection in the stem; way cool!', '2010-03-02 08:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886617, 857442, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very serene; nice light.  Would kind of prefer that old support not be in the view, but I don''t know if you had room to move to the left a bit to take the shot.</td>', 'Very serene; nice light.  Would kind of prefer that old support not be in the view, but I don''t know if you had room to move to the left a bit to take the shot.', '2010-03-02 08:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886618, 857230, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light and detail.</td>', 'Nice light and detail.', '2010-03-02 08:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886619, 856544, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great expression :-)  Fun image.</td>', 'Great expression :-)  Fun image.', '2010-03-02 08:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886623, 857644, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unusual sort of frame; I like it.</td>', 'Unusual sort of frame; I like it.', '2010-03-02 09:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886630, 857449, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOVE the framing on this one!  The framed scene is nicely composed and I love the texture of the wall.  Kinda'' want that black shiny thing (grill?) to not be there, but it would spoil the framed scene if you took this from a different angle.</td>', 'LOVE the framing on this one!  The framed scene is nicely composed and I love the texture of the wall.  Kinda'' want that black shiny thing (grill?) to not be there, but it would spoil the framed scene if you took this from a different angle.', '2010-03-02 09:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886633, 856930, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a noble face!  Like the composition.  Think I''d prefer focus be on the dog instead of the door, but it''s not a strong preference.</td>', 'What a noble face!  Like the composition.  Think I''d prefer focus be on the dog instead of the door, but it''s not a strong preference.', '2010-03-02 09:07:13.000000', NULL, 1);
