(5887211, 856544, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great creative POV.  Nice B&amp;W processing.  Subject matter is interesting.  One of my top picks so far.</td>', 'Great creative POV.  Nice B&W processing.  Subject matter is interesting.  One of my top picks so far.', '2010-03-02 18:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887217, 857082, 103032, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing a similarly framed shot in another challenge.  If this is the same photog, I liked the other framing of the other photo as I do on this one.  With that said, I think the framing element (the bridge structure) "over takes/over powers" the main subject (the skyline).  If the skyline was more prominent, this would have been a very strong image for the challenge.  Just my humble opinion.  Still, it''s a nice photo.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'I remember seeing a similarly framed shot in another challenge.  If this is the same photog, I liked the other framing of the other photo as I do on this one.  With that said, I think the framing element (the bridge structure) "over takes/over powers" the main subject (the skyline).  If the skyline was more prominent, this would have been a very strong image for the challenge.  Just my humble opinion.  Still, it''s a nice photo.  Good luck on the voting.', '2010-03-02 18:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887225, 857214, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, nice framing, like the composition.  However, the main subject being the mountain, it''s looks "flat" from the haze of the atmosphere.  The foreground elements look sharper and better contrast than the mountain.  There''s a little bit of haloing around the art piece that frames the mountain too.  This has great potential.  I''m not a big post processor, so I couldn''t tell you how to fix these critiques.  Best of luck on the voting.</td>', 'Nice catch, nice framing, like the composition.  However, the main subject being the mountain, it''s looks "flat" from the haze of the atmosphere.  The foreground elements look sharper and better contrast than the mountain.  There''s a little bit of haloing around the art piece that frames the mountain too.  This has great potential.  I''m not a big post processor, so I couldn''t tell you how to fix these critiques.  Best of luck on the voting.', '2010-03-02 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
