(5893128, 857563, 104841, '<td valign="top">wow what an interesting collection of birds. The way you have burnt and blurred the edges does help draw the eye to the middle of shot.</td>', 'wow what an interesting collection of birds. The way you have burnt and blurred the edges does help draw the eye to the middle of shot.', '2010-03-07 07:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5893148, 856544, 104841, '<td valign="top">great black and white. The pose looks a little stiff and fake but other then that good job.</td>', 'great black and white. The pose looks a little stiff and fake but other then that good job.', '2010-03-07 08:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5893159, 856707, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice set up with a well place light on the back drop. Not highly original but nice all the same. I would have like to see some real grapes though with a some more detail in them.</td>', 'nice set up with a well place light on the back drop. Not highly original but nice all the same. I would have like to see some real grapes though with a some more detail in them.', '2010-03-07 08:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
