(5893351, 856995, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo -- tones, composition, sharpness all excellent -- but not framed in the traditional sense. I''d give you a higher score in another challenge. :)</td>', 'Wonderful photo -- tones, composition, sharpness all excellent -- but not framed in the traditional sense. I''d give you a higher score in another challenge. :)', '2010-03-07 12:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
