(5894950, 857060, 70503, '<td valign="top">So cute! Congrats!</td>', 'So cute! Congrats!', '2010-03-08 13:45:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5895020, 857161, 47541, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/><b>First impressions</b> are of the lovely smoothness of the reflections in the water.<br/> <br/><b>Technically</b> I think this is good. The sky is exposed well. Composition is good given what you were trying to do. <br/> <br/><b>Artistically</b> the appeal of the colours and patterns is lost on us a little as we have it twice (sky and water). Other than the colours and patterns there isn''t much to this shot to comment on.<br/> <br/><b>In summary</b> a good shot that with some cropping would make a good sunrise shot. I do feel that the framing element was lost to many on this though.<br/> <br/>Feel free to <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/messaging.php?action=compose&amp;USER_ID=47541" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">PM me</a> if you have any queries.<br/>Gerry</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club. First impressions are of the lovely smoothness of the reflections in the water. Technically I think this is good. The sky is exposed well. Composition is good given what you were trying to do.  Artistically the appeal of the colours and patterns is lost on us a little as we have it twice (sky and water). Other than the colours and patterns there isn''t much to this shot to comment on. In summary a good shot that with some cropping would make a good sunrise shot. I do feel that the framing element was lost to many on this though. Feel free to PM me if you have any queries.Gerry', '2010-03-08 14:35:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5895085, 857214, 61315, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your score and I''m sure with different PP you would have scored even higher. Great scene though Brent!</td>', 'Congrats on your score and I''m sure with different PP you would have scored even higher. Great scene though Brent!', '2010-03-08 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 0),
