(5898372, 857589, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>What a nice, technically good, and well framed image.  <br/> <br/>But it didn''t score well.  I rather think your comments spell out the reason: the frame is great, but it''s what is (or is not)inside the frames that probably was your downfall in the scoring arena.  <br/> <br/>Oh, for a rowboat in the water, or a person (in a red jacket?) standing in one of the frames.  <br/> <br/>I''m always glad to see one of your images.  They usually have something interesting to say.  Keep ''em coming!  (I know you will.)<br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  What a nice, technically good, and well framed image.   But it didn''t score well.  I rather think your comments spell out the reason: the frame is great, but it''s what is (or is not)inside the frames that probably was your downfall in the scoring arena.   Oh, for a rowboat in the water, or a person (in a red jacket?) standing in one of the frames.   I''m always glad to see one of your images.  They usually have something interesting to say.  Keep ''em coming!  (I know you will.) Alice', '2010-03-10 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
