(5905836, 857638, 59029, '<td valign="top">Hello fellow CC member!<br/> <br/>I like the roundness of the logs showing towards us, and the natural dark red of the wood pops out against the mossy green rocks and silky water. Ambient lighting is soft and filtered, no harsh shadows or too much glare except for a teeny bit on the water.  Nice dof and good use of long exposures.<br/> <br/>I see this though as a piece of nature framed by nature, which may have contributed to a relatively low score for this shot. Replace the logs with, say, discarded pop bottles, and I daresay you would have scored much higher.  Still, a finish in the top 20% is nothing to sneeze at, so good work! <br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with any questions,<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Hello fellow CC member! I like the roundness of the logs showing towards us, and the natural dark red of the wood pops out against the mossy green rocks and silky water. Ambient lighting is soft and filtered, no harsh shadows or too much glare except for a teeny bit on the water.  Nice dof and good use of long exposures. I see this though as a piece of nature framed by nature, which may have contributed to a relatively low score for this shot. Replace the logs with, say, discarded pop bottles, and I daresay you would have scored much higher.  Still, a finish in the top 20% is nothing to sneeze at, so good work!  Feel free to PM me with any questions, Susan', '2010-03-15 19:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5908246, 856815, 100393, '<td valign="top">Gave this an 8 - very high quality work.</td>', 'Gave this an 8 - very high quality work.', '2010-03-17 12:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5909182, 857531, 69008, '<td valign="top">The flash and VR worked together to make this little guy stand out from the jungle.  I like the one toe being up. it''s as if he''s trying to tell you something.  Most people who are not photographers never notice how beautiful and colorful real birds can be.</td>', 'The flash and VR worked together to make this little guy stand out from the jungle.  I like the one toe being up. it''s as if he''s trying to tell you something.  Most people who are not photographers never notice how beautiful and colorful real birds can be.', '2010-03-17 23:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5909469, 857160, 98339, '<td valign="top">this almost looks like one of the Follies in St. Louis, MO at first I thought that was where this was...IMO I think that what hurt you (like mine, the entry <b>after</b> yours) is the sharpness of focus...and for me the graininess of the picture...either you needed more grain (to be more obvious) or you need to use a noise filter to smooth out the noise in your picture....</td>', 'this almost looks like one of the Follies in St. Louis, MO at first I thought that was where this was...IMO I think that what hurt you (like mine, the entry after yours) is the sharpness of focus...and for me the graininess of the picture...either you needed more grain (to be more obvious) or you need to use a noise filter to smooth out the noise in your picture....', '2010-03-18 09:57:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5909475, 857075, 98339, '<td valign="top">ahhhhh, Penny. I''m in the Comment above and below your entry thread <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=post&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=973696" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Link</a>.  So here it goes...I gave you a 6 on this as I thought that it was pretty good, but IMO I would have used a noise filter to smooth out your background a bit more...that is really the only "improvement" that I can see...and to me this has the framing (the background).  I wonder what this would be like in B&amp;W??</td>', 'ahhhhh, Penny. I''m in the Comment above and below your entry thread Link.  So here it goes...I gave you a 6 on this as I thought that it was pretty good, but IMO I would have used a noise filter to smooth out your background a bit more...that is really the only "improvement" that I can see...and to me this has the framing (the background).  I wonder what this would be like in B&W??', '2010-03-18 10:00:54.000000', NULL, 0),
